                  <div class="ledger-chip-row"><span class="tone-chip tone-info">spec</span> <span class="tone-chip tone-danger">High</span></div>
                  <div class="ledger-subtle">Initialization</div>
                </div>
                <div class="ledger-body">
                  <div class="ledger-title">Server ignored the requested MCP protocol version.</div>
                  <p class="ledger-copy"><strong>Remediation:</strong> Echo the negotiated protocol version in initialize.result.</p>
                  <div class="ledger-links">Spec: <a href="https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-11-25/basic/lifecycle">https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-11-25/basic/lifecycle</a></div>
